			"notes": "# New features\n- Automatic team chat\n- Team chat configuration\n- Tick reload of the hunter's compasses\n- Default config\n- Direct message (/msg) config\n- Admins can now kill the game (force reset at any moment)\n\n# Major changes\n- No /me command (conflicts with team chat and direct message config)\n\n# Bug patches\n- On game end players get tped in the overworld and no longer in their current dimensions\n- Hunters are now freed on instant release config\n- AllowedHostManager could end up with null data\n\n# Improvements\n- Using enum arguments types for more code efficiency\n- New mod icon\n- Addressed some typos\n- Added kick message when the server resets\n- Newly set headstart is displayed in the chat\n\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/TechnoMastery/ManhuntHelper/compare/6.3...7.0"
